---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Cancellation & Refund Policy | Ekwly</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/ekwly/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-page text-main antialiased selection:bg-primary-light selection:text-primary min-h-screen py-10 px-4 md:px-8">
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-surface border border-border rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm">
      <div class="mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-border flex items-center justify-between">
        <a
          href="/ekwly/"
          class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors">
          ← Return to App
        </a>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-widest">Legal</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-main mb-2">Cancellation & Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Effective Date: October 5, 2026</p>

      <section class="space-y-6 text-sm text-main/90 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">1. Peer-to-Peer Payments Between Users</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Ekwly is a calculation tool and does not process, handle, intermediate, or escrow funds
            settled between group members. Any money sent between users via UPI or cash is an
            off-platform transaction governed exclusively between the sender and recipient. Ekwly
            cannot issue refunds, reverse charges, or arbitrate disputes for funds sent to friends
            or venues.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">2. Ekwly Pro Digital Subscriptions</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Purchases of digital features, scan capacity, or subscription tiers (such as "Ekwly
            Pro") constitute immediate digital goods:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-muted mt-2">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-main">Web Purchases (Razorpay / UPI):</strong> Requests for
              subscription refunds submitted within 48 hours of billing are evaluated on a
              case-by-case basis if technical errors prevented quota fulfillment. Email your payment
              transaction ID to <span class="font-mono text-main">support@ekwly.app</span>.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-main">Google Play Store Purchases:</strong> If purchased through
              Google Play In-App Billing, refunds are governed by Google Play's standard refund
              policies and must be requested directly through Google Play support.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">3. Subscription Cancellation</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            You may cancel recurring subscriptions at any time. Upon cancellation, your access to
            unlimited scans and premium features will continue through the conclusion of the current
            prepaid billing period without renewal.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
